---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="PixelDiet — Image & CDN Optimization | CC3PO">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <a href="/products/" class="text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-emerald-400 transition">&larr; Back to all products</a>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between gap-8 mb-12">
      <div class="flex-1">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">PixelDiet</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 mb-6">Automated image optimization that shrinks your pages, speeds up your site, and cuts bandwidth costs — all served blazing fast through Cloudflare CDN.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="https://checkout.cc3po.com/b/pixel-diet-basic" class="inline-block bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg transition">Start Optimizing — $39/mo</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 text-center flex-shrink-0 w-full lg:w-64">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">Starting at</p>
        <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-emerald-400">$39</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">per month</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-2">Cancel anytime</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- What It Is -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">What Is PixelDiet?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
        PixelDiet is an automated image optimization service that watches for new images on your website, 
        converts them to modern formats (WebP, AVIF), compresses them without visible quality loss, and 
        serves them through Cloudflare's global CDN. Your pages load faster, your bandwidth bill shrinks, 
        and your visitors get a better experience — all on autopilot.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- How It Works -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">How It Works</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">1</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Watch &amp; Detect</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">We monitor your site for new images. When one appears, our pipeline kicks in automatically.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">2</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Optimize &amp; Convert</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">libvips converts to WebP and AVIF, applies smart compression, and strips metadata — all with no visible quality loss.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">3</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Serve via CDN</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Optimized images are served through Cloudflare's global CDN with cache headers, automatic format negotiation, and edge caching.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Features -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Features</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          <span class="text-gray-400">Automatic WebP &amp; AVIF conversion</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          <span class="text-gray-400">Smart lossless compression (40-80% size reduction)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          <span class="text-gray-400">Cloudflare CDN delivery with edge caching</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          <span class="text-gray-400">Automatic format negotiation (browser picks best)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          <span class="text-gray-400">Metadata stripping (EXIF, XMP, ICC profiles)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          <span class="text-gray-400">Daily bandwidth savings reports</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          <span class="text-gray-400">Monthly PDF savings report</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          <span class="text-gray-400">Cancel anytime</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pricing -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Plans &amp; Pricing</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Basic -->
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-1">Basic</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">For small sites</p>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-4">$39<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-normal">/mo</span></p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6 flex-1">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              1 site
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              WebP conversion
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Smart compression
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Daily bandwidth report
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://checkout.cc3po.com/b/pixel-diet-basic" class="block w-full text-center bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition">Subscribe — $39/mo</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Advanced -->
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col relative">
          <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-emerald-500 text-black text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Popular</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-1">Advanced</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">For growing businesses</p>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-4">$97<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-normal">/mo</span></p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6 flex-1">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Up to 3 sites
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              WebP + AVIF conversion
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Cloudflare CDN delivery
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Format negotiation
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Daily + monthly reports
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://checkout.cc3po.com/b/pixel-diet-advanced" class="block w-full text-center bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition">Subscribe — $97/mo</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Enterprise -->
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-1">Enterprise</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">Full pipeline + video</p>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-4">$197<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-normal">/mo</span></p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6 flex-1">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Unlimited sites
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              WebP + AVIF + video optimization
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Cloudflare CDN + Workers
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Priority support
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Custom integration
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://checkout.cc3po.com/b/pixel-diet-enterprise" class="block w-full text-center bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition">Subscribe — $197/mo</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Savings Calculator -->
    <div class="mb-12 bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">What You Save</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-emerald-400">40-80%</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">File size reduction</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-emerald-400">2-5x</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Faster page loads</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-emerald-400">100%</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Autopilot — set &amp; forget</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">How does PixelDiet integrate with my site?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">You point us to your image directory or upload endpoint. We watch for new files, optimize them, and serve the optimized versions through Cloudflare. No code changes needed on your end.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Will I lose image quality?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">No. Our smart compression is visually lossless. We use perceptual quality metrics to ensure images look identical while being 40-80% smaller. You can set your own quality threshold if desired.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">What about existing images on my site?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">We can do a one-time bulk optimization of all existing images when you sign up. After that, new images are optimized automatically.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0f0f1a] border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Do I need Cloudflare already?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">No. We set up Cloudflare as part of onboarding. If you already use Cloudflare, we integrate with your existing setup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="text-center py-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ready to shrink your images?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">Start with our Basic plan for $39/mo. Cancel anytime.</p>
      <a href="https://checkout.cc3po.com/b/pixel-diet-basic" class="inline-block bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-semibold px-10 py-4 rounded-lg transition text-lg">Get Started</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
